# Cloudflare Pages: client-side routing.
#
# The router owns /my-plot, /queries/:id and the rest. Without this, a refresh
# or a shared link on any of those paths asks Pages for a file that does not
# exist and gets a 404. 200 rewrites them to the app shell so the router can
# take over. Real files (/assets/*) are served before this rule is consulted.
/*    /index.html   200
